								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=340"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13445#msg13445"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13445#msg13445">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #30 on:</b> December 29, 2004, 02:32:26 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							play eq all you want, wow blows away any other mmorpg on the market, and i am a die hard coh fanboy<br />eq is a steaming pile of rancid dogshit and i hope it dies in the face, i doubt many people would leave WoW for EQ, there is just no comparison in the gameplay, the quest system, the backstory, the content, the lack of LOADING.....PLEASE WAIT bullshit, the stability even with large groups..... die eq die<br /><br />your mileage will vary
						</td>
					</tr>
