	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13457"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236" title="View the profile of Gonaiel">Gonaiel</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 94<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/demon1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13457#msg13457"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13457#msg13457">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #39 on:</b> December 29, 2004, 11:03:59 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							For the most part people play EQ to Raid and for High End content of some sort.&nbsp; That would be about 90 % maybe a toiuch less or more.&nbsp; So Eq is based on raiding not the little grinds but more about who killed who and who has what gear.&nbsp; Only a few guilds raid and have a family content maybe one or two at most.&nbsp; DA/EIE and most along them lines are raid mandatory meaning you will be at at like 75% of the raids or your gone.&nbsp; The other one is the family guild that doesnt last to awful long becuse they cant raid crap like king of coolness ( not a real guild just an example).&nbsp; So If DA/EIE and the high end scene can&#039;t get people from the lowbie/family guilds then they will die off the raiding scene also.&nbsp; With out new people coming into the game the high end raid scene sucks hard but damn just thionk of the gear a person can get with out all that competition.&nbsp; I think EQ was great its still fun when I quit and I wouldnt rule out coming back maybe but its not what it was thanks to SOE and the greedy eyes and not caring for there fan/player base.&nbsp; If you like WoW( awsome game ) then play that,&nbsp; EQ2 play that or eq 1 play that.&nbsp; But EQ is in a world of hurt becuse SOE didnt think this would happen and try to prevent this along time ago.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
