							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">&nbsp; I&#039;m not sure why some feel the need to convince EQ players the other games are better.&nbsp; It kinda feels like the Jehovah Witness knocking at my door.&nbsp; I don&#039;t need to be saved from EQ!&nbsp; I promise! </div><br />Good analogy.&nbsp; I keep getting the feeling that posters on various EQ forums are trying to get those of us in EQ1 to switch over to WoW or EQ2.&nbsp; Thanks, but no thanks.&nbsp; 
