								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13463#msg13463"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13463#msg13463">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #43 on:</b> December 30, 2004, 10:45:13 am &#187;</span></td>
