							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							At this stage of the game, you are 100% correct, but just as little as one month ago, there were many many more people in raiding guilds of some sort that were at least elemental levels.<br /><br />Most having at least 100 tagged members. Some more, some less, but I would hazard a safe bet the average was around 100 over all.<br /><br />I think this vague percent that many people throw out stating that raiders only made up 10-15% of each server is way too low, it was more than likely split closer to 50-50.
